@host = http://localhost:5080

### Liveness
GET {{host}}/health/live

### Readiness
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### System info
GET {{host}}/api/v1/system/info
Accept: application/json

### Unknown route -> 404 ProblemDetails
GET {{host}}/api/v1/does-not-exist

### OpenAPI document
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json
